(
    title: "Tax Avoiders",
    developer: Some("John Simonds, Todd Clark Holm"),
    description: Some("John Q has one year to clear a million dollars after tax, alternating between an income screen where he gathers cash across four levels of bureaucracy while dodging red tape, and a shelter screen where he grabs tax-sheltered investments. A single pursuer cycles by colour between an IRS agent who audits at fifty percent, a CPA who sells a better shelter, and an advisor who gives the best one."),
